  "notes": "Primary (from about age 6) has early grades 1-3 and upper grades 4-6; intermediate and secondary restart their numbering at 1. Secondary (الثانوية العامة) follows the Tracks system (نظام المسارات): a common first year, then two years in one of five tracks (general, health and life, computer science and engineering, business administration, sharia); the Ministry's guide calls the years السنة الأولى/الثانية/الثالثة or الأول/الثاني/الثالث الثانوي."
